    "name": "MICRO-ZOO",
    "steam_appid": 3584690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Microbial World.<br><br>Here, you have the power to create and engineer your own Micro-Morphs.<br><br>Micro-Morphs are unique customizable microorganisms.<br><br>Build Apex Micro-Morphs and dive as deep as you can in the Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you encounter. The deeper you go the more parts you will find,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but the more dangerous it will be to your Micro-Morphs.<br><br>You have been given a Petri Dish to run your experiments in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize and upgrade it to your liking.<br><br>Because this is your... MICRO-ZOO!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Microbial World.<br><br>Here, you have the power to create and engineer your own Micro-Morphs.<br><br>Micro-Morphs are unique customizable microorganisms.<br><br>Build Apex Micro-Morphs and dive as deep as you can in the Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you encounter. The deeper you go the more parts you will find,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but the more dangerous it will be to your Micro-Morphs.<br><br>You have been given a Petri Dish to run your experiments in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize and upgrade it to your liking.<br><br>Because this is your... MICRO-ZOO!</p>",
    "short_description": "MICRO-ZOO is a Creature Creating, Dungeon Crawling, Base Building, Turn-Base Battler. Create and Evolve your Creatures/Micro-Morphs from Parts that you gather from Rogue-lite Dives. Customize your Base with Decorations to boost your Micro-Morphs to go deeper into the games Biomes.",
